----------------------------------------------------------------
ASSETS - AUDIO
----------------------------------------------------------------

All audio (SFX + ambient music) in this project was procedurally
generated using Python (NumPy + wave module) by the project author.

  Generated by : Project author
  License      : MIT (same as source code)
  Files        :
    audio/sfx/plant.wav    - Plant action blip
    audio/sfx/harvest.wav  - Harvest success (double note)
    audio/sfx/water.wav    - Watering chirp
    audio/sfx/buy.wav      - Buy item beep
    audio/sfx/sell.wav     - Sell item beep
    audio/sfx/error.wav    - Error noise burst
    audio/sfx/select.wav   - UI select blip
    audio/sfx/refill.wav   - Water refill chirp
    audio/sfx/save.wav     - Save success (double note)
    audio/sfx/text.wav     - Typewriter blip (dialog)
    audio/music/field.wav  - Ambient field music (45s loop)


